help: the trait `FromRequestRef` is not implemented for `NotAnExtractor`
 --> tests/ui/middleware/not_a_borrowing_extractor.rs:3:1
  |
3 | struct NotAnExtractor;
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = note: `with`, `filter` and `map_err` read the request without consuming it, so they take the extractors that borrow: `Query<T>`, `Path<T>`, `ClientIp`, `Dc<T>` (feature `di`) and the header types, but not `Json<T>` or any other body extractor
  = help: the following other types implement trait `FromRequestRef`:
            ()
            (T1, T2)
            (T1, T2, T3)
            (T1, T2, T3, T4)
            (T1, T2, T3, T4, T5)
            (T1, T2, T3, T4, T5, T6)
            (T1, T2, T3, T4, T5, T6, T7)
            (T1, T2, T3, T4, T5, T6, T7, T8)
          and $N others
  = note: required for `(NotAnExtractor,)` to implement `FromRequestRef`
